    "title": "Video Poker by Pokerist",
    "description": "<b>Welcome to the best Video Poker game!</b>\r\nDownload the game and play for free!\r\nExplore classic and multi-hand gameplay with fantastic graphics in Video Poker.\r\nChoose between classic gameplay or multi-hand mode, where you can play up to 25 hands at once!\r\nTry your luck and and have Vegas-style fun!\r\n\r\n<b><u>Game features:</u></b>\r\n<b>\u2022 FREE CHIPS</b> \u2013 Play the game every day to get free chips!\r\n<b>\u2022 CLASSIC AND MULTI-HAND VIDEO POKER</b> \u2013 Immerse yourself in classic and multi-hand Video Poker and enjoy the fantastic graphics!\r\n<b>\u2022 CHOOSE YOUR GAME</b> \u2013 Play the most popular video poker games:\r\n- Deuces Wild\r\n- Jacks or Better\r\n- Bonus Video Poker\r\n<b>\u2022 QUESTS</b> \u2013 Complete daily quests to get free chips!\r\n<b>\u2022 NO REGISTRATION</b>\u00a0\u2013 Get straight into the action. Choose guest mode to use our free casino app without registering.\r\n<b>\u2022 FAIR PLAY GUARANTEED</b>\u00a0\u2013 Our certified Random Number Generator (RNG) gives you the best and fairest Video Poker experience!\r\n<b>\u2022 YOUR OWN PROFILE PAGE</b>\u00a0\u2013 Track your current status and progress in the game! Get experience and level up. See how many games you've played and achievements you've completed. Get unique properties and display them on your profile. View other players' profiles to see how you compare!\r\n\r\n\u2665\ufe0f\u2666\ufe0f\u2660\ufe0f\u2663\ufe0f <b><u>Want more than Video Poker?</u></b> \u2663\ufe0f\u2660\ufe0f\u2666\ufe0f\u2665\ufe0f\r\nTry our other games for an unforgettable 3D experience:\r\n<b>\u2022 TEXAS HOLD'EM POKER</b>\u00a0\u2013 The most popular casino game among professional gamblers! Test your skills in amazing poker tournaments!\r\n<b>\u2022 BLACKJACK</b> \u2013 A simple game of \u201c21\u201d. An exciting 3D game that any blackjack fan is sure to enjoy.\r\n<b>\u2022 ROULETTE</b>\u00a0\u2013 Featuring stunning 3D graphics and three table varieties: French, American, and European.\r\n<b>\u2022 OMAHA POKER</b> \u2013 A more dynamic version of poker with 4 cards in a hand. Have more fun with amazing combinations!\r\n<b>\u2022 SLOTS</b> \u2013 Explore our themed slots with lots of unique features!\r\n<b>\u2022 BACCARAT</b> \u2013 One of the most popular and exciting card games with superior 3D graphics!\r\n<b>\u2022 CRAPS</b> \u2013 The first 3D craps game ever. Make bets, roll the dice, take risks and become the best craps player!\r\n\r\nSubscribe to the official Facebook page of the game and be the first to find out about our promotions and news!\r\nhttps://facebook.com/Pokerist\r\nFollow us on Twitter and get free chips!\r\nhttps://twitter.com/KamaCasino",
